Proposed data location:

`%LOCALAPPDATA%\R3NOL\ASSIST ME\`

Use an appropriate shared service/lifetime strategy so multiple plugin instances do not each perform a full scan. Database concurrency and shutdown behaviour must be tested before enabling multiple instances.

