- Validate all backend responses before applying actions.

### 10.3 User consent and audio privacy

Captured DAW audio is user content. Any upload must be explicit, opt-in and clearly disclosed. The product must explain what is uploaded, why, where it is processed, retention expectations and how the user can opt out.

### 10.4 Assistant action safety

The assistant may suggest actions, filters or sounds. Any operation with material project impact must be shown clearly and require user confirmation. The assistant must report only actions that the plugin confirms actually occurred.

